":"Brand","viewport":"700x170","subtitle":"Red artwork on paper. Horizontal is the default lockup.","name":"Logo — primary"},{"path":"guidelines/mascots.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x210","subtitle":"Flat SADASA-branded learners. Human moments only; never mixed with photography.","name":"Mascots"},{"path":"guidelines/motif-ring.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x200","subtitle":"Classroom rows facing the mark. Anchored off-canvas, 8–20% opacity, one per surface.","name":"¾ ring motif"},{"path":"guidelines/photography.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x190","subtitle":"Warm, documentary, red t-shirts. Hard-edged frames, protection gradient over type.","name":"Photography"},{"path":"guidelines/service-icons.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x180","subtitle":"SADASA’s own two-colour outline artwork: red stroke, gold detail.","name":"Service & product icons"},{"path":"guidelines/color-budget.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"60% paper · 30% ink and neutrals · 10% red and gold. Red is the signal, not the field.","name":"The red budget"},{"path":"guidelines/color-charts.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Gold leads, red highlights the number that matters — the master deck’s own order.","name":"Chart series"},{"path":"guidelines/color-gold.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"The relief colour — already SADASA’s chart and product-icon colour. 500 is #F1B91A.","name":"Gold scale"},{"path":"guidelines/color-identity.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x170","subtitle":"The two constants. Never re-tuned.","name":"Identity colours"},{"path":"guidelines/color-neutrals.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Faintly warm so red never vibrates. 500 is #58595B, 800 is #313132.","name":"Neutrals"},{"path":"guidelines/color-red.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Hue locked to the identity red. 600 is #C40000, 500 is t