.card.html","group":"Motion","viewport":"700x180","subtitle":"Darken on hover, darken + 0.985 scale on press, 3px red focus ring. Opacity is never a state.","name":"Interaction states"},{"path":"guidelines/borders.card.html","group":"Shape","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Hairline separators, 2px strong, and the 3px red accent rule under headings.","name":"Lines & rules"},{"path":"guidelines/elevation.card.html","group":"Shape","viewport":"700x180","subtitle":"Print-derived: hairlines do the work, shadows are warm and barely there.","name":"Elevation"},{"path":"guidelines/radius.card.html","group":"Shape","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Crisp containers, fully round chips. Nothing uses a 24px+ friendly radius.","name":"Corner radii"},{"path":"slides/01-cover.html","group":"Slides","viewport":"1280x720","subtitle":"Red-ink cover with the ¾ ring, white vertical lockup and a dated subtitle.","name":"01 · Cover"},{"path":"slides/02-section-break.html","group":"Slides","viewport":"1280x720","subtitle":"Full-bleed photo with a protection gradient and one big number.","name":"02 · Section break"},{"path":"slides/03-agenda.html","group":"Slides","viewport":"1280x720","subtitle":"Two-digit ordinals, hairline dividers, one red rule.","name":"03 · Agenda"},{"path":"slides/04-text-quote.html","group":"Slides","viewport":"1280x720","subtitle":"Two columns of body copy beside a gold-ground pull quote.","name":"04 · Text + quote"},{"path":"slides/05-services.html","group":"Slides","viewport":"1280x720","subtitle":"The four services with SADASA’s own product icons.","name":"05 · Services"},{"path":"slides/06-data-bar.html","group":"Slides","viewport":"1280x720","subtitle":"Gold series with one red highlight, mono figures, hairline baseline.","name":"06 · Bar chart"},{"path":"slides/07-data-donut.html","group":"Slides","viewport":"1280x720","subtitle":"One number carries the slide; the rest is neutral.","name":"07 · Donut + big figure"},{"path":"slides/08-courses.html","group":"Sl